        "reference": "Psalms 140:5",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 140,
        "verse": 5
      },
      {
        "text": "I said unto the Lord, Thou art my God: hear the voice of my supplications, O Lord.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 27,
            "end": 30
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 6,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 140:6",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 140,
        "verse": 6
      },
      {
        "text": "O God the Lord, the strength of my salvation, thou hast covered my head in the day of battle.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 7,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 140:7",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 140,
        "verse": 7
      },
      {
        "text": "Grant not, O Lord, the desires of the wicked: further not his wicked device; lest they exalt themselves. Selah.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 77,
            "end": 81
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 8,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 140:8",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 140,
        "verse": 8
      },
      {
        "text": "As for the head of those that compass me about, let the mischief of their own lips cover them.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 0,
            "end": 6
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 9,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 140:9",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 140,
        "verse": 9
      },
      {
        "text": "Let burning coals fall upon them: let them be cast into the fire; into deep pits, that they rise not up again.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 10,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 140:10",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 140,
        "verse": 10
      },
      {
        "text": "Let not an evil speaker be established in the earth: evil shall hunt the violent man to overthrow him.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 98,
            "end": 102
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 11,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "Psalms 140:11",
        "book": "Psalms",
        "chapter": 140,
        "verse": 11
      },
      {
        "text": "I know that the Lord will maintain the cause of the afflicted, and the right of the poor.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 63,
            "end": 66
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 12,
